    "details": "<p><strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">About Capture The Flag (CTF)</strong></p>\n<p><span data-path-to-node=\"5,0\">Put your cybersecurity skills to the ultimate test in a 6-hour Capture The Flag (CTF) competition featuring hands-on challenges inspired by real-world security scenarios</span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2\">. Participants will identify vulnerabilities, analyze systems, solve security problems, and capture hidden flags across multiple cybersecurity domains</span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,4\">.</span></p>\n<p><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0\">Challenges range from beginner to advanced difficulty, requiring technical knowledge, analytical thinking, creativity, and teamwork to climb the dynamic live leaderboard</span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2\">.</span></p>\n<p><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Challenge Domains</strong></p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\n<li>Web Exploitation</li>\n<li>Cryptography &amp; Steganography</li>\n<li>Reverse Engineering &amp; Binary Exploitation</li>\n<li>Digital Forensics &amp; Network PCAP Analysis</li>\n<li>OSINT &amp; System Security</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Rules &amp; Guidelines</strong></p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Team Size:</strong> 1 to 2 members</span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0,2\">.</span></li>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Competition Duration:</strong> 6 Hours</span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0,2\">.</span></li>\n<li>Participants must carry their own laptops and chargers.</li>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0,0\">Participants may target only the designated CTF environment</span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0,2\">. Attacks against campus networks, other teams, or platforms are strictly prohibited</span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0,4\">.</span></li>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0,0\">DoS/DDoS attacks are strictly forbidden</span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0,2\">.</span></li>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"12,5,0,0\">AI tools, AI assistants, and AI-generated solutions are strictly prohibited</span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,5,0,2\">.</span></li>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"12,6,0,0\">Flags, solutions, exploits, or hints must not be shared between teams</span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,6,0,2\">.</span></li>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"12,7,0,0\">In case of a tie, the team achieving the score first ranks higher</span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,7,0,2\">.</span></li>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"12,8,0,0\">The judges' decision is final and binding</span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,8,0,2\">.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Event Details</strong></p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Date:</strong> 7th October 2026</li>\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Timings:</strong> 9:00 AM &ndash; 4:00 PM IST</li>\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Venue:</strong> Tech Lab 2, SRM IST, Ramapuram, Chennai</li>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Team Size:</strong> 1 &ndash; 2 Members</span></li>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"15,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration Fee:</strong> ₹300 per team</span></li>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"15,5,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Prize Pool:</strong> ₹5,000 Cash + Certificates</span></li>\n</ul>",
